    "turn_text": "whole team. So I'm so honored to be here with you and in this space. And thank you for addressing this issue. I will say that at the beginning of this hearing, I got really emotional. I had to shut off my video because never in my life have I seen so many people, including colleagues who didn't necessarily look like me, who didn't have the same background as me as an Asian American, talk out of concern, deep concern for what was going on in this country. And to see that show of you know, concern and support just really overwhelmed me. I got really emotional. This really was an effort by the Judiciary Committee to have a hearing where both Republicans and Democrats were actually invited to speak. And we were trying to find real solutions to this growing problem.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_09",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
